---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions — UK Calculator" 
  description="Review the Terms & Conditions of use for UK Calculator."
>
  <div class="crumb" style="padding: 16px 48px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
    <a href="/" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
    <span style="margin: 0 6px;">›</span>
    <span style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600;">Terms & Conditions</span>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 32px auto 80px; padding: 0 24px;">
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 28px;">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Terms of Use</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        By accessing and using <strong>UK Calculator</strong>, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Informational Purpose & Financial Disclaimer</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        All content, interactive tools, and estimates provided on UK Calculator are strictly for general informational and educational purposes. While we strive to maintain accurate, up-to-date statutory formulas (including 2026/27 HMRC rates), <strong>our tools do not constitute formal financial, tax, accounting, or legal advice</strong>.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        You should consult a qualified accountant, independent financial advisor, or legal professional before making significant financial or tax decisions.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        UK Calculator shall not be held liable for any loss, damage, or inaccuracy resulting from reliance on the calculation results generated by our site.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0;">
        All design assets, custom code, layout systems, and written content on UK Calculator are protected under UK intellectual property laws.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
